#. i18n: file: croppage.ui:22
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIPIPrintWizardPlugin::CropFrame, cropFrame)
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Move the box below to tell this wizard how to crop the photos to fit inside "
"the photo sizes you have given.  You can crop each image differently, or "
"just click 'Next' to use the default center cropping for each photo."
msgstr ""
"Verschuuv den Kasten nerrn, dormit de Hölper weet, wodennig de Fotos  na "
"Dien angeven Grötten tosneden warrn schöölt. Du kannst all Biller verscheden "
"tosnieden, oder eenfach op den Knoop \"Nakamen\" klicken, wenn Du all Fotos "
"standardwies merrn-topasst tosnieden wullt."

